\"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"3dc02269da5804718a594d52b5a585da67ff7fd6841c6430a55050f10e56745b","event_uuid":"a0fda7fa-a58f-4186-9fa5-e82c6f4b4116","position":{"commit_sha":"a6d0b08ba1df36f59786f3826147f99581c5b4b8","position":"1789899928109888670-a0fda7fa-a58f-4186-9fa5-e82c6f4b4116"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"close_class":"plan_defect","comments":[{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Completion evidence for the externally evidenced `make verify` acceptance criterion:\n\n- Gerrit change 3002, revision `0c56a96aafaedc2f7399ff4e15fc0d6499f665df`, received `Verified +1` from the CI bot for the gating `ubuntu-latest, py3.13` cell.\n- Gerrit submit returned `MERGED`; the merged commit on `origin/main` is `d08a0a373a36c89fd0c6f3df0e566d3fedfa27d5` (`d08a0a373a3`).\n- Local full `make verify` was intentionally not run on this macOS arm64 host because `pypandoc-binary==1.17`'s arm64 wheel ships an x86_64 `pandoc`, causing 17 unrelated pandoc tests to fail with `Bad CPU type in executable`.\n- Targeted tests ran from an extracted `d08a0a373a3` tree because the shared checkout differs from the merged revision; repo venv was on `PATH` and the extracted tree's `src` was pinned on `PYTHONPATH`.\n- `tests/unit/test_fixture_heal_heldout.py::test_production_attempter_creates_heal_work_dirs_before_manifest_write tests/unit/test_fixture_heal_heldout.py::test_production_attempter_runs_agentic_admission_inside_gate_read_root`: `2 passed in 0.58s`.\n- `tests/unit/test_fixture_heal_heldout.py::test_production_attempter_creates_heal_work_dirs_before_manifest_write`: `1 passed in 0.46s`.\n- `tests/unit/test_fixture_heal_heldout.py::test_production_attempter_runs_agentic_admission_inside_gate_read_root`: `1 passed in 0.42s`.","timestamp":1789899609516243029}],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1789014482829362001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"d944aec8-4eba-402b-98f0-d9dd5fd0d5e0","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"2340-d9a9-2e49-4c18"},{"link_uuid":"ea280d22-4758-4b4c-a3c0-58339973e7a9","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"47ae-9b35-de2b-4a48"}],"description":"## Context\nTriage is confirmed and narrowed. The live CLI path constructs `_ProductionAttempter` and calls `heal_fixtures` for non-dry-run `rebar criteria heal` at `src/rebar/_cli/_llm_eval_commands.py:135-137`. In `src/rebar/llm/evals/fixture_mining/heal.py`, `run` checks `_emitter_skips_unbalanced` before `_run_admission` at `heal.py:378-383`, so both branches must prepare their work context before admission can run.\n\n## Root Cause\n1. Missing heal work directories: `_emitter_skips_unbalanced` derives `.rebar/fixture_heal_manifests/<prompt>.jsonl` and `.rebar/fixture_heal_emit_preview/<prompt>` at `heal.py:440-444`, then calls `fixture_selection.write_manifest` before creating `manifest_path.parent`. `_run_admission` repeats the manifest write at `heal.py:459-463`. `write_manifest` opens the target directly at `src/rebar/llm/evals/fixture_selection.py:542-545`, so a repo without `.rebar/fixture_heal_manifests` raises `FileNotFoundError` before emit or admission.\n2. Missing gate read context: `_run_admission` builds a live runner at `heal.py:464`, then the solver calls `eval_solver.run_case` at `heal.py:466-467` without `gate_source.gate_read_root`. Agentic runner execution fails closed at `src/rebar/llm/runner.py:375-378`, with the required wrapper named at `src/rebar/llm/gate_context.py:217-222`.\n\n## Reproduction\nMissing manifest directory, no model call:\n\n```sh\nenv PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom tempfile import TemporaryDirectory\nfrom rebar.llm.evals.fixture_mining import heal\n\nwith TemporaryDirectory(prefix='rebar-heal-repro-') as d:\n    repo = Path(d)\n    try:\n        heal._emitter_skips_unbalanced('F1', [], repo)\n    except Exception as exc:\n        print(f'{type(exc).__name__}: {exc}')\nPY\n```\n\nCurrent output:\n\n```text\nFileNotFoundError: [Errno 2] No such file or directory: '/var/folders/1h/kbsb0jx91z1056_sk_z68cz00000gp/T/rebar-heal-repro-46e18443/.rebar/fixture_heal_manifests/plan-review-F1.jsonl'\n```\n\nMissing gate context, no model call; the shim only makes `run_admission` invoke the production solver once:\n\n```sh\nenv PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nfrom tempfile import TemporaryDirectory\nfrom rebar.llm.criteria.ids import criterion_prompt_id\nfrom rebar.llm.evals.fixture_mining import heal\nfrom rebar.llm.evals import fixture_admission\n\nwith TemporaryDirectory(prefix='rebar-heal-gate-repro-') as d:\n    repo = Path(d)\n    (repo / '.rebar' / 'fixture_heal_manifests').mkdir(parents=True)\n    heal._material_index = lambda _repo: {}\n\n    def fake_run_admission(_manifest_path, *, solver, **_kwargs):\n        return solver(criterion_prompt_id('T5c'), {'input': 'plan text'})\n\n    fixture_admission.run_admission = fake_run_admission\n    try:\n        heal._run_admission('T5c', [], repo, repo / 'ledger.jsonl', 1.0)\n    except Exception as exc:\n        print(f'{type(exc).__name__}: {exc}')\nPY\n```\n\nCurrent output:\n\n```text\nRuntimeError: agentic filesystem tools was attempted OUTSIDE the repo-snapshot gate process (epic raze-vet-ditch): a tool-using agent must run inside rebar.llm.gate_source.gate_read_root (attested snapshot or explicit local), never against the server's mutable checkout. Route the operation through gate_source, or set REBAR_GATE_ALLOW_UNGATED=1 to override (audited).\n```\n\n## Working Example\n`src/rebar/llm/evals/provider_parity.py:344-345` wraps eval solver work in `gate_source.gate_read_root(handle)` before item execution. `src/rebar/llm/completion.py:202-205` enters `gate_read_root(handle)` and applies the handle to the LLM config before verifier execution. `gate_read_root` marks both local and attested runs as gate sessions, activating the snapshot root for attested mode at `src/rebar/llm/gate_source.py:189-198`.\n\n## Implementation Plan\n1. In `src/rebar/llm/evals/fixture_mining/heal.py`, add a private helper near `_emitter_skips_unbalanced` that creates parent directories for the heal manifest path plus each derived output path before any write. Use it from `_emitter_skips_unbalanced` and `_run_admission`, because `run` reaches the emitter branch first at `heal.py:378-383`.\n2. In `_run_admission`, resolve a gate handle with `rebar.llm.gate_source.resolve_gate_handle(ref=None, source=None, repo_root=str(repo_root))`, enter `gate_source.gate_read_root(handle)`, and build the runner from `gate_source.apply_handle(LLMConfig.from_env(repo_root=str(repo_root)), handle)` before invoking `fixture_admission.run_admission`. Keep `repo_root=str(repo_root)` for `eval_solver.run_case` so criterion lookup still uses the caller's repo config.\n3. Add regression coverage to `tests/unit/test_fixture_heal_heldout.py`, which already covers `_ProductionAttempter` branches at `tests/unit/test_fixture_heal_heldout.py:253-343` and imports shared heal-loop scaffold from `tests/unit/test_fixture_heal.py:1-35`.\n\n## Rejected Alternatives\n- Do not set `REBAR_GATE_ALLOW_UNGATED=1`; `src/rebar/llm/gate_context.py:217-222` names that as an audited override and tells callers to route through `gate_source`.\n- Do not change `fixture_selection.write_manifest`; its contract is a byte-stable JSONL writer at `src/rebar/llm/evals/fixture_selection.py:542-545`, and this defect is in heal's derived work paths.\n- Do not wrap only nested `solve`; `src/rebar/llm/completion.py:202-205` shows config must be handle-applied before runner execution, or attested mode can still read the mutable checkout through runner config.\n- Do not classify this as unavailable material; `_ProductionAttempter.run` maps admission summaries to outcomes at `heal.py:385-392`, while both crashes occur before admission returns a summary.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/unit/test_fixture_heal_heldout.py::test_production_attempter_creates_heal_work_dirs_before_manifest_write tests/unit/test_fixture_heal_heldout.py::test_production_attempter_runs_agentic_admission_inside_gate_read_root` fails on baseline with `FileNotFoundError` or `RuntimeError: agentic filesystem tools was attempted OUTSIDE the repo-snapshot gate process`; exits 0 after the fix.\n- [x] `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/unit/test_fixture_heal_heldout.py::test_production_attempter_creates_heal_work_dirs_before_manifest_write` exits 0.\n- [x] `tests/unit/test_fixture_heal_heldout.py::test_production_attempter_creates_heal_work_dirs_before_manifest_write` asserts `_emitter_skips_unbalanced` plus `_run_admission` create `.rebar/fixture_heal_manifests` before `fixture_selection.write_manifest` opens the JSONL path.\n- [x] `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/unit/test_fixture_heal_heldout.py::test_production_attempter_runs_agentic_admission_inside_gate_read_root` exits 0.\n- [x] `tests/unit/test_fixture_heal_heldout.py::test_production_attempter_runs_agentic_admission_inside_gate_read_root` asserts the production admission solver executes inside `gate_source.gate_read_root` with a handle-applied `LLMConfig`, without `REBAR_GATE_ALLOW_UNGATED`.\n- [x] CI's gating `ubuntu-latest, py3.13` cell passes on the merged revision, evidenced by `Verified +1` on Gerrit change 3002 at `d08a0a373a3`. [non-codebase] The local `make verify` equivalent is not runnable on this macOS host: `pypandoc-binary==1.17`'s arm64 wheel ships an x86_64 pandoc, failing 17 unrelated tests.\n\n## Testing\nFocused regression: run the first AC command. Full contract: run the final AC command.\n","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/llm/evals/fixture_mining/heal.py","reason":"Create heal work directories and run live admission inside gate_source.gate_read_root with a handle-applied LLMConfig."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_fixture_heal_heldout.py","reason":"Add production-attempter regression tests for manifest-directory creation and agentic admission gate context."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","managed_refs":[["relates_to","47ae-9b35-de2b-4a48"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"399c4f2b-5880-4ef8-8a45-949dfeaff4aa","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":[],"ticket_id":"da2f-b473-0494-4e36","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Fixture heal live run lacks gate context","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["022304b4-0e6a-41be-90e7-c7c71564c1c3","5478ec26-f34b-4aea-95a2-39c8fb9b10be","994bfc9f-2c44-4928-9e35-70f06c346ade","753f8d03-6b31-44a7-908a-4bf6987bd0d9","f38af415-19a3-456c-ba1b-71b48ecccab8","d6c8f7ce-9099-4c25-960d-8624c08e3823","ea280d22-4758-4b4c-a3c0-58339973e7a9","c875e055-109a-42e1-96b4-a7077846c1c6","10094df0-8789-4ac1-9d6a-280495a386d1","399c4f2b-5880-4ef8-8a45-949dfeaff4aa","a0fda7fa-a58f-4186-9fa5-e82c6f4b4116"]},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1789903682361709679,"uuid":"654e7ee1-8f7e-4ab0-b716-79e36a900549"}